+Suite result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed; 0 skipped; finished in 945.16µs (206.37µs CPU time)
+
+Ran 1 test suite in 7.87ms (945.16µs CPU time): 0 tests passed, 1 failed, 0 skipped (1 total tests)
